  },
  {
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "この公開オーディションには予選と本選があって──",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "番組を盛り上げる意味でも、個人PRを積極的に行って\r\n多くの人に見てもらう機会を作ろうと思ってる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001003010190,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……個人でのPR活動……\r\nほわ……本当にひとりでの参加なんですね……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100301/1001003010190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ……でも、だからこそ、今まで以上にもっと広く\r\nアイドル櫻木真乃を知ってもらうチャンスになるはずなんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001003010200,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "──は、はい……っ\r\nそ、そうです、よね……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100301/1001003010200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………\r\n気が進まなかったら無理にとは言わないが──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001003010210,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……あっ、い、いえっ、すみません……っ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100301/1001003010210"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001003010220,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ここ最近はイルミネーションスターズでの──\r\n灯織ちゃんとめぐるちゃん３人でのお仕事が多かったので",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100301/1001003010220"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001003010230,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "えっと、その……今日のお仕事のお話も\r\n私が勝手に、３人一緒のだって思い込んでいて……",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100301/1001003010230"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001003010240,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "だから、あの……っ──だ、大丈夫ですっ\r\n今回のお仕事、ぜひ参加させてくださいっ",
    "charAnim1": "anger3",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100301/1001003010240"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001003010250,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ステージでひとりだったとしても\r\n挑戦したいです……っ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100301/1001003010250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "本当に大丈夫か？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001003010260,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はいっ\r\n……少しだけ心細いなって思っちゃいましたけれど",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100301/1001003010260"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001003010270,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ここまで３人で一緒に頑張ってきたことが、\r\n私の中にたくさんありますっ",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
